# Allow-list build context for both app images (built from the repo root).
# Order matters: `**` drops everything, the `!` lines re-include what a build needs, and the
# lines after them drop build output and local state again. `**/.env*` stays the last rule,
# so no env file can reach any build context, whatever a line above re-includes.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/**
!apps/**
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/src/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env*
